<BaseLayout
  wrapMain={false}
  title="Meet The Team | Finance with Flow"
  description="Meet the Finance with Flow team - the qualified accountants, bookkeepers and payroll specialists who become your outsourced finance department."
  bodyClass="page-template-default page page-id-24 elementor-default elementor-kit-7 elementor-page elementor-page-24"
>
  <div class="page-content">
    <Fragment set:html={`<main id="content" class="site-main post-24 page type-page status-publish hentry"><div class="page-content"><div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="24" class="elementor elementor-24" data-elementor-post-type="page"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-645e00c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="645e00c" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a512f2a e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="a512f2a" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9878722 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9878722" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our team members</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b93c76 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="0b93c76" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4058017 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4058017" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-341746f e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="341746f" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-edaff93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="edaff93" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Roz</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-741dc75 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="741dc75" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5e1b718 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5e1b718" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Managing Director​</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-629dea9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="629dea9" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Roz is the founder of Finance with Flow. A Chartered Accountant (FCA) with over 20 years of experience in setting up and leading Finance teams across small and large corporations, Roz built up a strong team of professionals who have expertise that cover all aspects of finance, providing other businesses with a ready-made Outsourced Finance Department.</p><p>Roz embodies her desire to enable businesses to thrive through Finance with Flow, who would not be able to access this with in-house personnel.</p><p>Outside of finance, Roz is a Mum of one, spending most weekends as taxi to the local mountain bike perks. She is a passionate advocate for holistic well-being and yoga, embracing a mindful and balanced lifestyle.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-be73a30 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="be73a30" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5653ff0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="5653ff0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-421 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-1024x1024.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800"   alt="managing director at Finance with Flow" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-300x300.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-150x150.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-768x768.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Rozalynne-Johnson-700x700.jpg 700w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-313ea1a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="313ea1a" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4752ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b4752ac" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-516a445 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="516a445" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-420 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-1024x1024.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800"   alt="management and systems accountant at Finance with Flow" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-300x300.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-150x150.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-768x768.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Nasser-Rabi-Laleh-700x700.jpg 700w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-418e438 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="418e438" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9012dac e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="9012dac" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2d5ec3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2d5ec3f" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Nasser</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32fd831 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="32fd831" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a4b8877 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a4b8877" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Management and Systems Accountant</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6d3d8bf  elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6d3d8bf" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Nasser is our Management &amp; Systems Accountant at Finance with Flow who has a big passion for numbers.</p><p>With over ten years of experience working in various finance roles, and being ACCA-qualified, Nasser is a self-confessed Excel geek and loves automation and streamlining processes.</p><p>Nasser supports clients by providing guidance and helps them really understand their numbers, to keep them doing what they do best.</p><p>Having managed various teams over the years, Nasser’s experience ensures that he always strives to make a difference!</p><p>Outside of work Nasseer sings in a band, likes to host quizzes and enjoys time with the family!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4431619 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="4431619" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4f5711f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4f5711f" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60831bb e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="60831bb" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f908efa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f908efa" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Fi</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e152c2f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="e152c2f" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b96e634 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b96e634" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Management Accountant</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d89e990 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d89e990" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Fi achieved her AAT qualification and and is continuing her studies to become a CIMA qualified Management Accountant.</p><p>Fi’s role at Finance with Flow allows her to really get to know our clients and become part of their team by supporting with the day to day running of the finance department, building relationships with clients team members at all levels. This allows Fi to develop a well-rounded picture of performance meaning suggestions of improvement and support any changes going forward can be provided.</p><p>In Fi’s spare time she enjoys spending time with her family, getting outdoors and learning to play the piano.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f40f3a6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f40f3a6" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-88d1013 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="88d1013" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-419 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-683x1024.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="683" height="1024"   alt="management accountant at Finance with Flow" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-683x1024.jpg 683w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-200x300.jpg 200w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-768x1151.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Fiona-Grange_-scaled.jpg 1708w" sizes="(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-71e33320 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="71e33320" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e279246 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e279246" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dc09829 e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="dc09829" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d3f155f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d3f155f" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Jackie</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-220e955e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="220e955e" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-937f523 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="937f523" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Bookkeeper</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-223d85a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="223d85a6" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Jackie’s role as Bookkeeper allows her to build upon expertise she acquired earlier in her career as an underwriting assistant for a Lloyds syndicate.</p><p>Jackie is passionate about data accuracy and prides herself on the precision of her work.</p><p>Jackie’s friendly and approachable nature means that she has great relationships with all of our clients.</p><p>Outside of Bookkeeping, Jackie is a mother of two boys and an assistant tennis coach at the local prep school. She holds various LTA qualifications and is a level 3 first aider.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-422ad4c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="422ad4c8" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-327addd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="327addd" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-418 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-683x1024.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="683" height="1024"   alt="bookkeeper at Finance with Flow" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-683x1024.jpg 683w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-200x300.jpg 200w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-768x1151.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Jackie-Jarvis-scaled.jpg 1707w" sizes="(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9f9cdf0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="9f9cdf0" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8de0f06 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8de0f06" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c298ded e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="c298ded" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8db0d78 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8db0d78" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Jo</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-39dd14e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="39dd14e" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16490b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="16490b4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Tax Manager</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6129989  elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6129989" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Jo has a wealth of experience in navigating the complexities of tax for our clients, ensuring any queries or doubts can be resolved before they become stressful.</p><p>Jo is a qualified ATT and CTA, and has worked in various roles dealing with everything from self assessments to international tax.</p><p>Outside of the office, Jo loves spending time with her family and enjoys running and swimming.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f3e531c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="f3e531c" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1d3d6ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1d3d6ff" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6da9ff0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6da9ff0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-422 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-1024x683.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="534"   alt="marketing manager at Finance with Flow" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Headshot-of-Lorri-Morley-2048x1366.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aac539b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="aac539b" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bba88ef e-flex e-con-boxed  e-con e-child" data-id="bba88ef" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d3d1a18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d3d1a18" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Lorri</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-98fb87e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="98fb87e" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-542f843 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="542f843" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Marketing Manager</h3></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e7ad665  elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e7ad665" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Lorri joins the team as Marketing Manager and has over 12 years of experience in this field. </p><p>At Finance with Flow, Lorri’s role is to combine her knowledge and strategic mindset in creating a bespoke marketing plan. </p><p>Understanding the business, needs and goals is what Lorri does best by immersing herself within the detail and becoming a brand rep for the company.</p><p>Lorri is kept busy outside of work with her two boys! And enjoys big country walks with friends and family, Coffee shop trips and a spot of DIY and upcycling around the house.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-45a7e0a4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="45a7e0a4" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-615fa87e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="615fa87e" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b986b7c elementor-hidden-mobile  elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="7b986b7c" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:250}" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1778 " src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Professional-collaboration-against-a-blue-backdrop-1024x683.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="534"   alt="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Professional-collaboration-against-a-blue-backdrop-1024x683.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Professional-collaboration-against-a-blue-backdrop-300x200.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Professional-collaboration-against-a-blue-backdrop-768x512.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Professional-collaboration-against-a-blue-backdrop.webp 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65d3ab17 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="65d3ab17" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-753f23ba  elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="753f23ba" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;,&quot;_animation_mobile&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Our dedicated team is the heartbeat of our mission to empower individuals and businesses to navigate the complex world of finance with confidence and ease.</p><p>With a blend of expertise, enthusiasm, and a touch of creativity, we’re here to transform financial jargon into opportunities for growth. Get to know the faces behind the solutions, and let’s embark on this journey towards prosperity together.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4fcffff2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="4fcffff2" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/services/"> <span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"> <span class="elementor-button-text">Explore our services</span> </span> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="post-tags"></div></div></main>`} />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


